# Version and push

On every code change in this project:

- Bump `version` in `manifest.json` before finishing. Patch (`1.1.1` → `1.1.2`) for a fix, minor for a new behavior. Do not leave the version unchanged.
- Keep the same version string in `popup/popup.html` (`#version`), so the loaded build is visible in the popup.
- Commit on `main` and push straight to `origin/main` (`https://github.com/Skobelkinsa/reborn_vote.git`) in the same turn. Do not open a pull request, do not push another branch, and do not force-push.
